32 位命令哈希实现。

```text
export function hashCommand(cmd) {
  let h = 5381
  for (let i = 0; i < cmd.length; i++) h = ((h << 5) + h + cmd.charCodeAt(i)) | 0
  return 'h' + (h >>> 0).toString(16)
}
```

